      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline quasi-static compressive strength is 1314 MPa.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline quasi-static fracture strain is 13.5%.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under dynamic adiabatic loading, unmodified HfZrTiTa0.53 has limited strain hardening, poor uniform deformability, and rapid failure.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is addition of 5–10 at.% W followed by controlled aging.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11767206::web::019::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding W and aging will produce a uniform dispersion of W-rich nanoscale precipitates in HfZrTiTa0.53.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-rich nanoprecipitates will obstruct dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Obstruction of dislocation motion by the precipitates will increase dislocation storage and work hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased work hardening will delay strain localization and adiabatic shear-band formation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Delayed localization will reduce rapid failure under high-strain-rate loading.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11767206::web::013::3_3_mechanical_properties_of_ti40zr40mo1",
        "PMC11767206::web::019::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The prediction applies at room temperature under adiabatic dynamic deformation at strain rates of approximately 10^3–10^4 s^-1.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11767206::web::013::3_3_mechanical_properties_of_ti40zr40mo1",
        "PMC11767206::web::019::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-modified alloy will have approximately 10–20% higher dynamic yield and compressive strength than the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11767206::web::013::3_3_mechanical_properties_of_ti40zr40mo1",
        "PMC11767206::web::019::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-modified alloy will exhibit greater uniform ductility and fracture strain than the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11767206::web::013::3_3_mechanical_properties_of_ti40zr40mo1",
        "PMC11767206::web::019::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-modified alloy will have greater resistance to dynamic strain localization than the baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-modified alloy will exhibit reduced and more gradual impact-induced energy release.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
